## Attribution

The measurements are the AIJ Urban Wind Environment benchmark, Cases A to M. Cite the data paper:

Kikumoto, H., Okaze, T., Yoshie, R., Tachibana, T., Ishihara, T., Nonomura, Y., Kiyota, N., Kondo, H., Mochida, A.,
Tominaga, Y. (2026). Comprehensive Experimental Database for Validating CFD Simulations in Urban Wind Environment:
Benchmark Cases Curated by the Architectural Institute of Japan. Japan Architectural Review 9(1), e70083.
https://doi.org/10.1002/2475-8876.70083

Each case lists its own data collectors, Zenodo DOI and requested citation in `/api/cases/{id}.json` and on its Data
page. The cleaned release and the API are cited as given in `CITATION.cff` and `/api/index.json` (`cite.api`).

